#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<iswalnum>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<isalnum>(3)  function.  It tests whether I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"alnum\"."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswalnum>() é a equivalente para caracteres largos da função "
"B<isalnum>(3). Ela testa se I<wc> é um caractere largo pertencente à classe "
"de caracteres largos 'alnum'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is a subclass of the wide-character class "
"\"graph\", and therefore also a subclass of the wide-character class "
"\"print\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe de caracteres largos 'alnum' é uma subclasse da classe de "
"caracteres largos 'graph', e portanto, também uma subclasse da classe de "
"caracteres largos 'print'."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Being a subclass of the wide-character class \"print\", the wide-character "
"class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class \"cntrl\"."
msgstr ""
"Sendo uma subclasse da classe de caracteres largos \"print\", a classe de "
"caracteres largos \"alnum\" é disjunta da classe de caracteres largos "
"\"cntrl\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Being a subclass of the wide-character class \"graph\", the wide-character "
"class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class \"space\" and its "
"subclass \"blank\"."
msgstr ""
"Sendo uma subclasse da classe de caracteres largos \"graph\", a classe de "
"caracteres largos \"alnum\" é disjunta da classe de caracteres largos "
"\"space\" e sua subclasse \"blank\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is disjoint from the wide-character class "
"\"punct\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe de caracteres largos \"alnum\" é disjunta da classe de caracteres "
"largos \"punct\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" is the union of the wide-character "
"classes \"alpha\" and \"digit\".  As such, it also contains the wide-"
"character class \"xdigit\"."
msgstr ""
"A classe de caracteres largos \"alnum\" é a união das classes de caracteres "
"largos \"alpha\" e \"digit\". Como tal, ela também contém a classe de "
"caracteres largos \"xdigit\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The wide-character class \"alnum\" always contains at least the letters "
"\\[aq]A\\[aq] to \\[aq]Z\\[aq], \\[aq]a\\[aq] to \\[aq]z\\[aq], and the "
"digits \\[aq]0\\[aq] to \\[aq]9\\[aq]."
msgstr ""
"A classe de caracteres largos \"alnum\" sempre contém no mínimo as letras de "
"\\[aq]A\\[aq] a \\[aq]Z\\[aq], \\[aq]a\\[aq] a \\[aq]z\\[aq] e os dígitos "
"\\[aq]0\\[aq] a \\[aq]9\\[aq]."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DE RETORNO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<iswalnum>()  function returns nonzero if I<wc> is a wide character "
"belonging to the wide-character class \"alnum\".  Otherwise, it returns zero."
msgstr ""
"A função B<iswalnum>() retorna um valor diferente de zero se I<wc> é um "
"caractere largo pertencente à classe de caracteres largos \"alnum\". Caso "
"contrário, ela retorna zero."

